Validate dialect definitions, schemas, or data

Usage: kdlith vet <COMMAND>

Commands:
  dialect  Load a dialect definition with its imports, compile, link, and check it
  schema   Vet a schema definition under the bundled dialect, or the one `--dialect` names, itself vetted with complete checking
  data     Bind data documents against the schema `--schema` names (or the dialect itself), under the bundled dialect or `--dialect`, then link their references; items go to stdout as JSON lines

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
error[KDLITH-CLI001]: a subcommand is required but one was not provided
